const ivec2 offsets[4]=ivec2[](ivec2(-1,0),ivec2(1,0),ivec2(0,-1),ivec2(0,1));
float laplacian(ivec2 p,ivec2 n,vec4 w,float center) {
    float value=-dot(w,vec4(1))*center;
    for(int i=0;i<4;i++) {
        ivec2 q=p+offsets[i];
        if(w[i]>0 && all(greaterThanEqual(q,ivec2(0))) && all(lessThan(q,n)))
            value+=w[i]*texelFetch(pressure,q,0).r;
    }
    return value;
}
